codex
The new regression fails on the accepted commit with the expected `concurrent_state_change` (`exit 1`), while both portable no-Go tests already pass (`exit 0`). I’m now changing only the cross-API comparison: identity uses Python’s path/descriptor-aware `samestat`, observable content fields must still match, descriptor metadata must remain stable during the read, and a same-API `lstat` recheck will verify the path afterward.
