+# TASK-260720-2x6mjn Windows CI rework evidence
+
+## Review handoff
+
+- Accepted base SHA: `323ea47db821641bc68f2b9054b50e82642a6df2`
+- Rework commit: `b3a5031ed551b27a298eef486a068b5175beaacc`
